### Send single price update
POST http://localhost:8110/api/prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 101,
  "oldPrice": 150.00,
  "newPrice": 145.50
}

### Send batch of price updates
POST http://localhost:8110/api/prices/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "productId": 201,
    "oldPrice": 50.00,
    "newPrice": 48.00
  },
  {
    "productId": 202,
    "oldPrice": 30.00,
    "newPrice": 25.00
  }
]

### Send invalid price update (should go to DLT)
POST http://localhost:8110/api/prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 999,
  "oldPrice": 100.00,
  "newPrice": -10.00
}

### Get a specific product price (wait a moment for Kafka consumer to process)
GET http://localhost:8110/api/prices/101
Accept: application/json

### Get all product prices
GET http://localhost:8110/api/prices
Accept: application/json
